{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23296","headline":"奉和李大夫题新诗二首各六韵 因严亭 · 白居易","name":"奉和李大夫题新诗二首各六韵 因严亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"箕颍人穷独，蓬壶路阻难。\n何如兼吏隐，复得事跻攀。\n岩树罗阶下，江云贮栋间。\n似移天目石，疑入武丘山。\n清景徒堪赏，皇恩肯放闲。\n遥知兴未足，即被诏徵还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}